            "review_title": "Review at Tapas Kitchen",
            "review_text": "Jennie M\nLancashire, United Kingdom228 contributions\n0\nAppalling customer service. Left.\nApr 2023 • Solo\nAlthough a solo visitor I wanted to treat myself so ordered 4 food items, a soft drink and a glass of wine. This was where the issue arose. They have three white wines by the glass, however were not willing to open a new bottle of my first or second choices to sell only one glass. I could have the Chardonnay they had open (which I dislike) only. I asked to speak to the manager but another waitress came over and said the same thing. So I left. Appalling customer service, particularly as it’s part of the hotel.\nRead more\nWritten April 7, 2023",
