            "review_text": "Davbesfoodie\nBairnsdale, Australia90 contributions\n0\nDelicious bites\nMar 2018 • Solo\nTried the tempura fish tacos, very tasty served with small salad. Then tried the terrine which was yummy, came with a nutty brittle and apple paste which went very well together. Choc brownie to finish, ok, not great. They make an amazing mojito.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 23, 2018\nCaravelleSaigon\nDear Davbesfoodie,\n\nThank you for your positive feedback on our culinary offerings and signature cocktails following your recent visit to our Tapas Kitchen. Your endorsement is not only a pleasure to receive, but also further motivates the whole team to keep providing outstanding service.\n\nWishing you continued safe travels and look forward to welcoming you back soon.\n\nFrom the Heart of Saigon,\n\nMichael Robinson\nGeneral Manager\nRead more\nWritten March 28, 2018\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
