            "review_text": "isaiahchoe\nSydney, Australia27 contributions\n0\nNice\nFeb 2018 • Couples\nFood was pretty average and a bit pricey but it is in Cafe de l'Opera and the atmosphere at night with Sitta Gomez singing makes it worthwhile\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 21, 2018\nCaravelleSaigon\nDear isaiahchoe,\n\nThank you for your comments following your recent visit to our Café de L’opera following your recent stay with us. I trust you had an enjoyable time in the evening’s ambience listening to our resident singers Jazzon and Sitti. Regarding the price, according to our recent market survey of 5 star hotels, we are moderately priced compared to our competitors in Saigon.\n\nWe do look forward to welcoming you back soon.\n\nFrom the Heart of Saigon,\n\nMichael Robinson\nGeneral Manager\nRead more\nWritten March 5, 2018\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
