            "review_text": "Steffus\nOaklyn, New Jersey115 contributions\n0\nGreat Freshly prepared items\nMar 2017 • Couples\nWe sat right at the bar and watched the 2 chefs expertly prepare and garnish our dishes. Was a nice quick bite and reasonable. Smoothies were very tasty as well, they offer a wonderful selection based on your taste. Great variety of Tapas from traditional to local. Something for everyone.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 10, 2017\nCaravelleSaigon\nDear Steffus,\nThank you for your positive feedback. We are glad to hear you were pleased with our authentic culinary offerings. I trust you had a memorable time enjoying our chefs prepare the dishes at the counter in which you are dining.\n\nWishing you continued safe travels and look forward to welcoming you back soon.\n\nFrom the Heart of Saigon\n\nMichael Robinson\nGeneral Manager\nRead more\nWritten April 17, 2017\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
