            "review_text": "Barney K\nKorumburra, Australia2 contributions\n0\nCaravelle top corner Bar\nOct 2016 • Friends\nthis the best spot in Saigon to sit in a window and watch the world go by all the different vehicles and motorbikes in their hundreds with a view across to the Opera House and straight up the street to the Post Office & Cathedrals both a must see\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 8, 2016\nCaravelleSaigon\nDear Barney K,\n\nThank you for your endorsement on our fabulous Tapas Kitchen where you can watch life passing by in Lam Son Square through the Lounge’s large glass windows. Wishing you continued safe travels and look forward to welcoming you back soon.\n\nFrom the Heart of Saigon,\n\nMichael Robinson \nGeneral Manager\nRead more\nWritten December 12, 2016\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
