            "review_text": "ben_c20\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam277 contributions\n0\nExcellent tapas!\nJul 2016 • Couples\nLocated on the ground floor of the Caravelle hotel, Tapas Kitchen is a bar like counter which seats just 4! The menu is rather limited but the food is fabulously delicious. We had the beef Samoa and the battered mussels which was plated in shot glasses suspended on an interesting display. The food was really good and we look forward to sampling the other dishes on the menu.\nRead more\nWritten July 24, 2016\nCaravelleSaigon\nDear ben_c20,\n\nThank you for your comment on our Tapas Kitchen, we are delighted to hear that you enjoyed our culinary offering here. We look forward to welcoming you back in the not too distant future.\n\nJuan Costa Ribas (Mr.)\nExecutive Assistant Manager - Food & Beverage\nRead more\nWritten August 23, 2016\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
