            "review_text": "dees99\nSydney, Australia37 contributions\n0\nVery good tapas close to the Opera\nOct 2015 • Friends\nI bought a voucher when I booked the AO show, it was about 100,000 VND more to have dinner included. \n\nAmazing value, a beer or soft drink, 3excellent quality tapas choices, the servings are huge and tasty!\nFinished off with coffee or tea.\n\nThe tapas\nTuna - very high quality tuna - delicious. I could have fad 3 servings of these alone\nMushroom bruschetta - ok, I didn't like the creamy sauce\nDuck croquets, very tasty, nice hard crust and soft duck and mash centre\nFish and chips, ok\nChicken, very tender, yummy sauce\nBeef mince in betel leaves, traditional Vietnamese, tasty!\n\nI should have order some lighter tapas like the fig and cheese as I was too full by the end. \n\nI had the seafood buffet at nineteen a few nights before. I enjoyed the tapas more.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten October 13, 2015",
